  "resume": "This is a television news report from the Swiss public broadcaster SRG SSR that covers the handover of petition signatures to the Federal Chancellery in Bern regarding the status of the Bernese Jura districts. It documents a key moment in the Jura conflict concerning the administrative affiliation of Courtelary, Moutier, and La Neuveville. The footage shows the physical act of submitting the petition."
